---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import TopBar from "../../components/TopBar.astro";
import { v, importmap } from "../../lib/v.mjs";
---
<Page
  title="Clean Paste: Word and Google Docs to Clean HTML | jsal.io"
  description="Turn Word or Google Docs text into clean HTML, or HTML back into formatted text. WordPress blocks too. Free, in your browser, nothing uploaded."
  path="/formatter/"
  ogDescription="Clean up content pasted from Word or Google Docs: clean HTML, formatted text or WordPress blocks. Free and entirely in your browser."
  ogImage="formatter"
  ogImageAlt="Clean Paste: Word and Google Docs to clean HTML, with SEO checks"
  icon="/img/icons/clean-paste.svg"
  mono={false}
>
<script is:inline slot="head" type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebApplication",
    "name": "Clean Paste",
    "url": "https://jsal.io/formatter/",
    "description": "Paste content from Word, Google Docs, a web page or HTML code and get clean HTML, formatted text or WordPress blocks, with heading and link checks. Runs entirely in the browser.",
    "dateModified": "2026-10-30",
    "applicationCategory": "UtilitiesApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Any (web browser)",
    "isAccessibleForFree": true,
    "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "USD" },
    "author": { "@type": "Person", "@id": "https://jsal.io/#john", "name": "John Salvador", "url": "https://jsal.io/" },
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://jsal.io/#website" }
  }
  </script>
<link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href={v("styles.css", "/formatter/")}>
<script is:inline slot="head" type="importmap" set:html={importmap("/formatter/", ["./js/main.js", "./js/clean.js", "./js/sample.js"])}></script>
<script is:inline slot="head" type="module" src={v("js/main.js", "/formatter/")}></script>
  <main class="app">

    <!-- Top bar shared by every jsal.io app (styles in /shell.css; the logo menu and theme button come from /nav.js) -->
    <TopBar class="app-header"><h1 slot="title" class="jsal-title"><img class="jsal-title-ico" src={v("/img/icons/clean-paste.svg")} alt="" width="22" height="22">Clean <span class="hl">Paste</span><span class="sr-only">: Word and Google Docs to Clean HTML</span></h1>
<a class="jsal-link" href="#about">About</a></TopBar>
    <p class="jsal-for">For writers and editors pasting from Word or Google Docs into WordPress, Shopify, Wix or any CMS.</p>

    <section class="side" aria-label="Checks and copy">

      <div class="results">
        <h2 class="section-label" id="checksH" tabindex="-1">Checks</h2>
        <p class="side-empty" data-no-content>Paste something to see word count, reading time and anything worth fixing.</p>
        <div class="stats" id="stats" data-needs-content></div>
        <ul class="checks" id="checks" data-needs-content></ul>
        <!-- Read out by screen readers: the checks' summary after a paste, and the line Show moves to -->
        <p class="sr-only" id="checksSay" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p class="sr-only" id="checkSay" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <button type="button" class="back-to-checks" id="backToChecks" hidden>↑ Back to checks</button>
      </div>

      <div class="actions" data-needs-content>
        <button class="jsal-btn primary" id="copyRich" title="For visual editors like Squarespace, Wix, Shopify and WordPress">
          <span class="ico" data-icon="copy"></span>Copy formatted
        </button>
        <div class="actions-row">
          <button class="jsal-btn" id="copyHtml" title="For HTML / code views"><span class="ico" data-icon="code"></span>Copy HTML</button>
          <button class="jsal-btn" id="copyText" title="Plain text, no formatting"><span class="ico" data-icon="text"></span>Copy text</button>
        </div>
        <button class="jsal-btn" id="copyWp" title="Gutenberg block markup: paste into the WordPress block editor to get real blocks"><span class="ico" data-icon="code"></span>Copy WordPress blocks</button>
        <div class="actions-foot">
          <span class="toolbar-hint" id="copyNote" aria-live="polite"></span>
          <button class="jsal-btn danger small" id="clearBtn"><span class="ico" data-icon="trash"></span>Clear</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="work" aria-label="Content">

      <!-- Empty state: paste anywhere on the page, or start typing -->
      <div class="paste-zone" id="pasteZone" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Paste content here">
        <div class="paste-icon"><span class="ico" data-icon="clipboard" data-size="20"></span></div>
        <p class="paste-title">Paste your content</p>
        <p class="paste-sub">Copy from Word, Google Docs, a web page, HTML code or plain text, then press <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>V</kbd> anywhere on this page.</p>
        <p class="paste-links"><button class="jsal-btn link" id="pasteBtn" hidden>Paste from clipboard</button><span aria-hidden="true" id="pasteSep" hidden>·</span><button class="jsal-btn link" id="blankBtn">Start with a blank page</button><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><button class="jsal-btn link" id="sampleBtn">Try an example</button><span aria-hidden="true" id="undoSep" hidden>·</span><button class="jsal-btn link" id="undoClearBtn" hidden>Undo clear</button></p>
        <p class="paste-note" id="pasteNote" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p class="paste-privacy">Everything stays in your browser. Nothing is uploaded.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pane pane-out" data-needs-content>
        <div class="pane-head">
          <span class="pane-title">Clean <span class="pane-meta" id="outMeta"></span></span>
          <div class="jsal-seg" role="tablist" aria-label="Clean view">
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="tabPage" data-tab="out" data-view="page" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="editor" title="Edit the formatted text">Text</button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="tabCode" data-tab="out" data-view="code" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="htmlEdit" tabindex="-1" title="Edit the HTML directly">HTML</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Formatting toolbar for the editor (data-cmd runs a command, see main.js) -->
        <div class="toolbar" id="toolbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Formatting">
          <button data-cmd="bold" title="Bold (Ctrl+B)" aria-label="Bold"><b>B</b></button>
          <button data-cmd="italic" title="Italic (Ctrl+I)" aria-label="Italic"><i>I</i></button>
          <span class="tb-sep"></span>
          <button data-cmd="h2" title="Heading 2 (Ctrl+Alt+2, or type ## and a space)">H2</button>
          <button data-cmd="h3" title="Heading 3 (Ctrl+Alt+3, or type ### and a space)">H3</button>
          <button data-cmd="h4" title="Heading 4 (Ctrl+Alt+4)">H4</button>
          <button data-cmd="p" title="Normal paragraph (Ctrl+Alt+0)" aria-label="Paragraph">¶</button>
          <span class="tb-sep"></span>
          <button data-cmd="ul" title="Bulleted list (Ctrl+Shift+8, or type - and a space)" aria-label="Bulleted list"><span class="ico" data-icon="ul"></span></button>
          <button data-cmd="ol" title="Numbered list (Ctrl+Shift+7, or type 1. and a space)" aria-label="Numbered list"><span class="ico" data-icon="ol"></span></button>
          <span class="tb-break"></span>
          <button data-cmd="link" title="Add or change link (Ctrl+K)" aria-label="Link"><span class="ico" data-icon="link"></span></button>
          <button data-cmd="unlink" title="Remove link" aria-label="Remove link"><span class="ico" data-icon="unlink"></span></button>
          <button data-cmd="clear" title="Clear formatting from the selection" aria-label="Clear formatting"><span class="ico" data-icon="eraser"></span></button>
          <span class="tb-sep"></span>
          <button data-cmd="unboldAll" class="tb-wide" title="Remove bold from the whole post (headings stay headings)">Remove all bold</button>
          <span class="tb-grow"></span>
          <button data-cmd="undo" title="Undo (Ctrl+Z)" aria-label="Undo"><span class="ico" data-icon="undo"></span></button>
          <button data-cmd="redo" title="Redo (Ctrl+Y)" aria-label="Redo"><span class="ico" data-icon="redo"></span></button>
        </div>

        <!-- HTML tab bar -->
        <div class="toolbar" id="htmlBar" hidden>
          <button data-format title="Tidy up the indentation and line breaks (Shift+Alt+F)" class="tb-wide"><span class="ico" data-icon="wand"></span>&nbsp;Format</button>
          <span class="toolbar-hint" data-touch="Formats automatically when you tap away">Formats automatically when you click away · Shift+Alt+F</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pane-body">
          <div class="preview" id="editor" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="true" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Clean content, editable" aria-describedby="tabPage"></div>
          <textarea class="code" id="htmlEdit" spellcheck="false" aria-label="HTML, editable" aria-describedby="htmlEditKeys" hidden></textarea>
          <span class="sr-only" id="htmlEditKeys">Tab indents. To leave the box, press Escape, then Tab.</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Link box: shows under a link when the cursor is in it, or on Ctrl+K (see main.js) -->
        <div class="link-box" id="linkBox" role="group" aria-label="Edit link" hidden>
          <input type="text" id="linkUrl" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" placeholder="https://" aria-label="Link address" />
          <button type="button" id="linkSave" title="Save (Enter)">Save</button>
          <a id="linkOpen" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Open in a new tab" aria-label="Open link"><span class="ico" data-icon="external"></span></a>
          <button type="button" id="linkRemove" title="Remove link" aria-label="Remove link"><span class="ico" data-icon="unlink"></span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Fragment set:html={`<!-- About: below the app (which fills the first screen); styles in /shell.css -->`} />
  <section class="jsal-about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
    <h2 id="about-h">About Clean Paste</h2>
    <p class="jsal-lead">Checks your post before it goes live (stray H1s, bold lines that should be headings, draft and "click here" links) and copies it for any editor, as HTML or as WordPress blocks.</p>
    <p>It turns content copied from Word, Google Docs or a web page into clean, minimal HTML, keeping the real structure: headings, lists, links, tables, bold and italic.</p>

    <h3>How to use it</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Copy your content from Word, Google Docs, a web page or an HTML file<span id="howPaste">, and press <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>V</kbd> anywhere on the page</span>.</li>
      <li>Read the checks. <span data-touch="Tap">Click</span> <strong>Show</strong> on any check to jump to the line it means.</li>
      <li>Fix things in the <strong>Text</strong> tab with the toolbar (headings, lists, links, remove all bold), or edit the code in the <strong>HTML</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Copy the result: <strong>formatted</strong> for visual editors like Shopify, Squarespace and Wix, <strong>HTML</strong> for code views, <strong>plain text</strong>, or <strong>WordPress blocks</strong> for the block editor.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>It works the other way too: paste HTML code and copy it back as formatted text.</p>

    <details>
      <summary><h3>What it cleans up</h3></summary>
      <ul>
        <li>Inline styles, fonts, spans, classes and Word's hidden markup and comments.</li>
        <li>Word's fake bullet and number paragraphs, rebuilt as real nested lists.</li>
        <li>Google Docs redirect links, changed back to the real address, and links starting with www. given https://.</li>
        <li>Images, marked as [Image] placeholders so you know where to upload them in the CMS.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary><h3>Keyboard shortcuts</h3></summary>
      <p>The same keys as WordPress's block editor and Google Docs, in the <strong>Text</strong> tab:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Headings: <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd class="alt-key">Alt</kbd> + <kbd>2</kbd>, <kbd>3</kbd> or <kbd>4</kbd> for H2 to H4, and <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd class="alt-key">Alt</kbd> + <kbd>0</kbd> for a normal paragraph. Or type <kbd>##</kbd> and a space at the start of a line (<kbd>###</kbd> for H3).</li>
        <li>Lists: <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>8</kbd> for bullets and <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>7</kbd> for numbers, or type <kbd>-</kbd> or <kbd>1.</kbd> and a space at the start of a line.</li>
        <li>Bold <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd>, italic <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>I</kbd>, link <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd>, undo <kbd class="mod-key">Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Z</kbd>.</li>
        <li>In the <strong>HTML</strong> tab: <kbd>Tab</kbd> indents, <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Tab</kbd> un-indents, <kbd>Esc</kbd> then <kbd>Tab</kbd> leaves the box, and <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd class="alt-key">Alt</kbd> + <kbd>F</kbd> tidies the code.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary><h3>What it checks</h3></summary>
      <ul>
        <li>An H1 in the body (most CMSs already use the title as the H1) and skipped heading levels.</li>
        <li>Lines that are only bold text and were probably meant as headings.</li>
        <li>Links to drafts, file shares or local files, Word bookmark links, links that go nowhere, "click here" link text, the same page linked more than once, and http:// links.</li>
        <li>Paragraphs over 150 words. It also shows the word count and reading time.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>

    <h3>Common questions</h3>
    <dl>
      <dt>Is it free?</dt>
      <dd>Yes, with no sign-up and no limit.</dd>
      <dt>Which CMSs does it work with?</dt>
      <dd>Any that accepts formatted text or HTML: WordPress (including block editor markup), Shopify, Wix, Squarespace, Webflow, HubSpot and others.</dd>
    </dl>

    <p class="jsal-feedback">Useful? Ideas or problems? <a href="mailto:dev@jsal.io?subject=Clean%20Paste">Email me</a>.</p>
    <p><svg class="jsal-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="jsal-mark-tile" x=".5" y=".5" width="31" height="31" rx="6.5"/><path class="jsal-mark-j" d="M20 15V20a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-9 0"/><path class="jsal-mark-gem" d="M20 5l3 3-3 3-3-3z"/></svg>Made by <a href="/">John Salvador</a>. Also try the <a href="/image-resizer/">Image Resizer</a> for resizing and cropping images in bulk, or <a href="/cms-picker/">CMS Picker</a> to compare what each CMS can do. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Page>
